python scripts/code_quality_checker.py . --language java

# JSON output
python scripts/code_quality_checker.py /path/to/code --json
```

**Universal thresholds:**

| Issue | Threshold |
|-------|-----------|
| Long function | >50 lines |
| L','.claude\skills\code-reviewer\SKILL.md','230858dd047b607bd621c294d0ae8dd439649378cb089ee65980a9034b23628f','skill,simplicio,coding',1.3);
