name: copywriting
description: Use to write or sharpen UI text and marketing copy — headlines, CTAs, value props, button labels, error messages, landing-page sections, emails — so it''s clear, benefit-led, and persuasive. Trigger on "write the copy", "improve this headline/CTA", "escreve o texto", "melhora a copy", microcopy for buttons/errors, or any words a user reads to understand or act.
source: methodology skill (sujeitoprogramador.com 2026 list — Copywriting); Simplicio-native, no external dependency
